{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.FluidDynamics.levi_growth_trichotomy","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.levi_growth_trichotomy","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Archimedean","lean:module:Mathlib.Order.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp"],"declarations":16,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.levi_marginal_undetermined","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.levi_marginal_undetermined","kind":"theorem","line":178,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/levi_growth_trichotomy.lean#L178-L179","doc":"**Alias** of `QOU.FluidDynamics.growthExponent_marginal`.\n\n---\n\nStructure-level form of `beta_marginal_undetermined`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.levi_trichotomy_exhaustive","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.levi_trichotomy_exhaustive","kind":"theorem","line":175,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/levi_growth_trichotomy.lean#L175-L176","doc":"**Alias** of `QOU.FluidDynamics.growthExponent_trichotomy`.\n\n---\n\nStructure-level form of `beta_trichotomy`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.bounded_condNumber_forces_beta_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.bounded_condNumber_forces_beta_zero","kind":"theorem","line":172,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/levi_growth_trichotomy.lean#L172-L173","doc":"**Alias** of `QOU.FluidDynamics.bounded_seq_forces_beta_zero`.\n\n---\n\n**A bounded sequence has exponent `0`.**  If `a` is bounded then no\npositive exponent survives `beta_lower`, because `κ^(β/2) → ∞` overtakes any\nbound.  (Its former reading as the branch-(A) identification of `β = 0`\nwith a bounded Levi condition number is withdrawn; file docstring.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.bounded_seq_forces_beta_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.bounded_seq_forces_beta_zero","kind":"theorem","line":135,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/levi_growth_trichotomy.lean#L135-L170","doc":"**A bounded sequence has exponent `0`.**  If `a` is bounded then no\npositive exponent survives `beta_lower`, because `κ^(β/2) → ∞` overtakes any\nbound.  (Its former reading as the branch-(A) identification of `β = 0`\nwith a bounded Levi condition number is withdrawn; file docstring.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.growthExponent_marginal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.growthExponent_marginal","kind":"theorem","line":128,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/levi_growth_trichotomy.lean#L128-L131","doc":"Structure-level form of `beta_marginal_undetermined`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.growthExponent_trichotomy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.growthExponent_trichotomy","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/levi_growth_trichotomy.lean#L123-L126","doc":"Structure-level form of `beta_trichotomy`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.GrowthExponent.beta_lower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.GrowthExponent.beta_lower","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/levi_growth_trichotomy.lean#L120-L120","doc":"**…and it is attained:** for every `ε > 0`, `κ^(β-ε) ≤ a_κ` for\ninfinitely many `κ`. Upper and lower together say exactly\n`limsup_κ log a_κ / log κ = β`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.GrowthExponent.beta_upper","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.GrowthExponent.beta_upper","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/levi_growth_trichotomy.lean#L115-L115","doc":"**`beta` is an upper exponent:** for every `ε > 0`, `a_κ ≤ κ^(β+ε)` for\nall large `κ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.GrowthExponent.beta_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.GrowthExponent.beta_mem","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/levi_growth_trichotomy.lean#L112-L112","doc":"**Bounded-rate regime:** `0 ≤ β ≤ 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.GrowthExponent.beta","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.GrowthExponent.beta","kind":"def","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/levi_growth_trichotomy.lean#L110-L110","doc":"Growth exponent `β = limsup_κ log a_κ / log κ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.GrowthExponent.seq_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.GrowthExponent.seq_pos","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/levi_growth_trichotomy.lean#L108-L108","doc":"Positivity — without it `log a_κ` is meaningless. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.GrowthExponent.seq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.GrowthExponent.seq","kind":"def","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/levi_growth_trichotomy.lean#L106-L106","doc":"The sequence `a_κ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.GrowthExponent.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.GrowthExponent.mk","kind":"ctor","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/levi_growth_trichotomy.lean#L104-L104","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.GrowthExponent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.GrowthExponent","kind":"structure","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/levi_growth_trichotomy.lean#L97-L121","doc":"A positive real sequence `seq` with growth exponent\n`beta = limsup_κ log seq(κ) / log κ ∈ [0, 1]`, the `limsup` written out\nwithout `Filter` as `beta_upper` / `beta_lower`.\n\nFormerly `LeviGrowthTrichotomy`, with `seq` read as the Levi condition\nnumber and two branch fields; both readings and both fields are withdrawn\n(file docstring). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.beta_marginal_undetermined","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.beta_marginal_undetermined","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/levi_growth_trichotomy.lean#L85-L89","doc":"**The open window is a genuine third case.** When `0 < β < 1`, neither\n`β = 0` nor `β = 1` holds. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.beta_trichotomy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.beta_trichotomy","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/levi_growth_trichotomy.lean#L75-L83","doc":"**The trichotomy is exhaustive on `[0, 1]`.** Every exponent in `[0, 1]`\nis `0`, in `(0, 1)`, or `1`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}